        <p>•A: No. 570. HOSPITAL • , TRAINED NURSES . INSTITUTION :5 MALE AND FEMALE NURSES AND •• ATTENDANTS Z I MEDICAL SURGICAL &amp; MONTHLY NURSES C" SUPPLIED TO IN- CI MEDICAL PROrrssicH Pueu.: HOSPITALS Z AND PRIVATE FAMILIES HGPE SIR LIVERPOOL. as:</p>
