        <head>IRUMICORN BOARD OF GUARDIANS.</head>
        <p>IRUMICORN BOARD OF GUARDIANS.</p>
        <p>The usual fortnightly meeting of thid Board was held ht the Workhouse, Dutton, on Tuesday. Mr j moseleft Williams presided. On account of the death of ne.a Majesty Queen Victoria, the Board-room was draPe„ with black, purple, and white. The other Bunco" Guardians present were T Lea and T BO.; nolds these, with the members of the Rural Distr, Council. the clerk (Mr George F Ashton), deputy-oleo' (Mr W B Hough), and the Master (Mr Joseph Cunnso made up the full attendance. After reference to the Queen and a resolution of synl; pathy with the Royal Family, the ordinary business *vs' proceeded with.</p>
