        <head>WAR.</head>
        <p>THE WAR.</p>
        <p>Orange River Colony.</p>
        <p>An Armoured Train in Action.</p>
        <p>SMALDEEL, TUESDAY (delayed in transmission).</p>
        <p>An armoured train went out yesterday and ex- changed shots with two hundred of the enemy. Shelling has been going on all day since this morn- ing at the Tabaksberg Hills.</p>
