        <p>Fell and Edmondson, the twe new Warrington for wads, did as well as null b../cpeeted. Judging by results they improved matters in the scrimmage, while Tell showed plenty of energy in the open. Time will disclose their worth, and at present it is impossible to form an opinion en their abilities. All one can say is, that they look "likely.' 1</p>
