        <p>,eath was the opening-out of a newer, purer and holier life. This life our late Queen now enjoyed, "hey could say truly" 0 death wh‘Te is thy sting, 0 rave where is thy victory." Might this thou.fht corn- Lont them ever in the midst of their sadness and sorrowl to-day. But as they thought over the event of last Tues..' day culminating with the event next Saturday,when all that was mortal of our Queen would be placed in its last resting-place, might they not say in the words of that well-known hymn,</p>
